# U49 a: Summary view with allflame_exp_048: the header row (the two build names, col3R moved
# right of the compare name), DrawStatList (player stats; spacers, flag filters, condFunc
# rows, formatted values, differences with percentages), the power report section (the
# metric label and controls positioned by DrawSummary, RunComparePowerReport with no metric,
# the list emptied by SetReport(nil, nil)), wheel scrolling (scrollY moves every row and
# the controls).
#! u49-import allflame_exp_048.xml
#! u49-expect-text ^7Compare Power Report
#! u49-expect-text ^7Difference
screen 1600 900 dpi 1
fixture userdir=../u46/user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
move 116 98
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 700 500
frames 2
wheel down 3
frames 2
wheel down 3
frames 2
wheel up 1
frames 2
